        <mxCell id="r08_t17" value="从库默认只读；读写分离能分摊读，但主库仍是写瓶颈。" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=8.8;fontColor=#DC2626;fontFamily=PingFang SC;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
